\item[S2] Danny Calegari, \emph{Problems in foliations and laminations of 3-manifolds}, version 0.78 (2002), Question 14.2; Definitions 1.1--1.10 and local definitions and remarks. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0209081v1}.
